# Copy to `.env` and edit. Two settings, and only the first is load-bearing.
#
# Nothing here is prefixed `VITE_`, and that is deliberate: that prefix is what
# makes a variable reach the browser bundle. The address of the Mais Cidadão
# service has no business being inlined into JavaScript a phone downloads, so it
# stays here, on the server side, where Vite's `envPrefix` drops it.
#
# See "The DTO boundary" in the README.

# The Mais Cidadão service. Scheme and host, no trailing slash, no path.
#
# REQUIRED — the server refuses to boot without it. There is no safe default: a
# guessed URL either fails everything, or silently points a batch of real
# submissions somewhere nobody intended. A filed protocol has no undo.
UPSTREAM_URL=https://exemplo-do-servico.gov.br

# The port serving the app AND the API, together, from one process. 4173
# because phones already have it bookmarked.
PORT=4173
